sequenceDiagram
    participant SDK as MLflow SDK Client
    participant Gateway as ODH Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant MLflow as MLflow Server<br/>5000/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant KAuth as kubernetes-auth plugin
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over SDK,S3: Flow 1: SDK Client Experiment Tracking

    SDK->>Gateway: POST /mlflow/api/2.0/mlflow/runs/create<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Gateway->>MLflow: Forward request<br/>Bearer Token forwarded
    MLflow->>KAuth: Authenticate request
    KAuth->>K8sAPI: SelfSubjectAccessReview<br/>mlflow.kubeflow.org resources<br/>SA Token
    K8sAPI-->>KAuth: Allowed/Denied
    KAuth-->>MLflow: Auth result
    MLflow->>PG: INSERT run metadata<br/>Workspace-scoped query
    PG-->>MLflow: OK
    MLflow-->>Gateway: 200 JSON response
    Gateway-->>SDK: Run ID + metadata

    Note over SDK,S3: Flow 2: Artifact Upload

    SDK->>MLflow: PUT /api/2.0/mlflow-artifacts/artifacts/{path}<br/>Bearer Token
    MLflow->>KAuth: Authenticate request
    KAuth->>K8sAPI: SelfSubjectAccessReview
    K8sAPI-->>KAuth: Allowed
    KAuth-->>MLflow: Auth result
    MLflow->>S3: PUT object<br/>AWS credentials/IRSA<br/>TLS
    S3-->>MLflow: OK
    MLflow-->>SDK: 200 OK

    Note over SDK,S3: Flow 3: UI Access via ODH Dashboard

    participant Browser as User Browser
    participant Dashboard as ODH Dashboard<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Browser->>Dashboard: Access MLflow UI<br/>OpenShift OAuth
    Dashboard->>MLflow: Embedded/linked request<br/>5000/TCP<br/>Bearer Token
    MLflow->>KAuth: Authenticate
    KAuth->>K8sAPI: SelfSubjectAccessReview
    K8sAPI-->>KAuth: Allowed
    KAuth-->>MLflow: OK
    MLflow-->>Dashboard: UI content
    Dashboard-->>Browser: Rendered UI
